  "name": {
   "zh": "深度与摄影机 · MapAnything",
   "en": "Depth and Camera · MapAnything"
  },
  "intro": {
   "zh": "MapAnything 官方自述：端到端训练的 transformer，从画面、标定、位姿、深度贴图这几类输入回归出真实尺度三维几何。这张卡交付每帧摄影机（USD 与 Nuke 摄影机，都是去抖后的，没有旁路）、深度贴图和点云（对应原始摄影机；每帧一张点图，各在自己的摄影机里）。默认的「主权重」非商用，商用请把「模型」换成「Apache」。",
   "en": "MapAnything describes itself as an end-to-end trained transformer that regresses metric 3D geometry from images, calibration, poses and depth maps. This card delivers per-frame cameras (USD and Nuke camera, both deshaken, no bypass), depth maps and point clouds (for the original camera; one pointmap per frame, each in its own camera). The default main weights are non-commercial; for commercial use set Model to Apache."
  },
  "author": "Lab2Shot",
  "created": "2026-09-11T11:00:00",
  "deliverable": "depth_camera",
  "owner": "admin",
  "updated": "2026-10-03T01:00:00"
 },
